@maithilijoshi20 @njhill @yewentao256, #61161 is an alternative fix for the same issue. I have completed its DFlash2/LiLiCorr and DSpark paths, so it now covers those direct samplers too.

The implementation difference is that #61161 derives the round key inside existing kernels from positions and draft-step metadata, without passing an extra round-position tensor. I ran the same four multi-round distribution cases on both implementations, including your head `170dcc217`, with only an argument adapter for the different sampler API. Both pass.

I am keeping #61161 as a complete fix, including the probabilistic-draft distribution regression. Please take a look at its in-kernel approach for landing this repair.
